zBrain extends Promaia with:
- Postgres/pgvector on Supabase (cloud-native storage)
- Proactive brain layer (briefings, action extraction, directives)
- Gemini as first-class model (specialist routing, not fallback)
- Heartbeat agent (autonomous overnight work)

Collaboration model: branch & contribute back. Features built here
can be cherry-picked upstream by Promaia maintainers.

See docs/plans/2026-03-04-zbrain-promaia-merge-design.md for full design.

